msgid ""
"Makes unhandled rejected promises [fail "
"loudly](https://github.com/sindresorhus/loud-rejection) instead of the "
"default silent fail"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/meow_readme.md:15
msgid "Sets the process title to the binary name defined in package.json"
msgstr ""

